  "behavior": "It patrols the Skunk Pond and tends to fight more aggressively than the other koi. After locking onto a target, it often pulls away to create distance before charging back at high speed.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is extremely dangerous and cannot be killed. It has a strong tendency to use its charge against the player, so even keeping some distance does not guarantee safety.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It is one of the pond's main predators and may attack creatures encountered during its route. Its size and speed make it almost impossible for small creatures to stand against it.",
  "strategy": "Keep watching it even when it appears to be moving away: creating distance may be preparation for a charge. If it starts pulling away, be ready to change direction quickly and look for cover. As with the other koi, avoid at all costs having all three detect you simultaneously.",
